OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786040303
OL,3,CWelsh facing 'crisis' as language
OL,4,Cdwindles in communities across Wales
OL,6,FLast year, I was working from a coffee
OL,7,Fshop in Swansea when something curious
OL,8,Fhappened.
OL,10,FThere were three other customers and a
OL,11,Fbarista inside. We had all been
OL,12,Fspeaking English until the barista
OL,13,Frealised I could speak Welsh and
OL,14,Fswitched languages.
OL,16,FImmediately, the three other customers
OL,17,Frevealed that they were Welsh speakers
OL,18,Ftoo. Within a few seconds, the
OL,19,Flanguage of the coffee shop had
OL,20,Fchanged from English to Welsh.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786040303
OL,3,CWelsh facing 'crisis' as language
OL,4,Cdwindles in communities across Wales
OL,6,FIt left me wondering: How many times
OL,7,Fhad I spoken English to someone
OL,8,Fwithout realising that we were both
OL,9,Ffluent Welsh speakers?
OL,11,FIf you live in one of Wales' cities or
OL,12,Flarger towns, experiences like this
OL,13,Fare not unusual (the percentage of
OL,14,Fpeople who can speak Welsh in Swansea
OL,15,Ffor example is around 11%), but that
OL,16,Fbrief encounter gets to the heart of a
OL,17,Fgrowing concern.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
