OL,3,CWelsh facing 'crisis' as language
OL,4,Cdwindles in communities across Wales
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FAmong its recommendations was the
OL,12,Fdesignation of areas with a
OL,13,Fparticularly high density of Welsh
OL,14,Fspeakers, allowing policies to be
OL,15,Ftailored to their specific
OL,16,Fcircumstances.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
