PN,31213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786040303
OL,3,CWelsh facing 'crisis' as language
OL,4,Cdwindles in communities across Wales
OL,6,FIt also called for housing development
OL,7,Fto reflect local need and for the
OL,8,FWelsh language to be considered more
OL,9,Fconsistently within the planning
OL,10,Fsystem.
OL,12,FThe new Plaid Cymru government has
OL,13,Fpromised to legislate for additional
OL,14,Fprotections for these areas.
OL,16,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth told
OL,17,Fme those policies should not simply be
OL,18,Fviewed as a way of stopping houses
OL,19,Ffrom being built.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786040303
OL,3,CWelsh facing 'crisis' as language
OL,4,Cdwindles in communities across Wales
OL,6,F"You can look at it as something that
OL,7,Fprevents developments, but I also see
OL,8,Fit as a way of enabling developments,"
OL,9,Fhe said.
OL,11,F"Rural depopulation is a major
OL,12,Fproblem. We could then allow more
OL,13,Fhomes to be built in some areas. What
OL,14,Fwe need is a planning system that is
OL,15,Fsensitive to our linguistic needs, and
OL,16,FI see that in a positive way."
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@fO]sD@AOUxD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
