PN,31215
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786040303
OL,3,CWelsh facing 'crisis' as language
OL,4,Cdwindles in communities across Wales
OL,6,FThe Welsh language has proved
OL,7,Fremarkably resilient. And some of
OL,8,Fthese demographic changes are
OL,9,Fcontributing to increases in the
OL,10,Fnumber of speakers in places like
OL,11,FCardiff, where a record number was
OL,12,Frecorded this summer.
OL,14,FThe challenge now is ensuring Wales
OL,15,Fisn't just creating people who have
OL,16,Fthe ability speak Welsh, but people
OL,17,Fwho do so regularly.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
